                    "transcription": "$\\because y=(x-h)^2$ 顶点为$B(2,0)$\n$\\therefore B(2,0)$代入$y=(x-h)^2$\n$0=(2-h)^2$，$h=2$\n$\\therefore y=(x-2)^2$",
